In the desperation and confusion that accompanied the
invasion, the Alliance used anything they could get
their hands on for transport purposes. It was under
these circumstances that the Piranha first saw
widespread use. Since that time it has become
probably the best wheeled armoured carrier in the
Alliance army. Like other armoured vehicles it is
equipped with a 25-mm cannon and two machine guns.
The Piranha is popular as a recon vehicle, because of
its extraordinary speed and adaptability. On the other
hand, its rubber tires have trouble withstanding the
heat of fire spells. Nevertheless, the LAV-25 is still
mass produced, and under normal conditions presents
a deadly threat to lesser armed opponents.~
